Forger-mob greet~
0 g 100
~
wait 1s
say Greetings Adventurer and welcome to my forge.  The flame is warm; if you are cold come here and stand beside it.
wait 15
say If you would like some work done, I would be glad to offer you my services.  Type 'List' to see what I can offer you.
wait 20
say But beware!  Forging is a dangerous process which can cause as much harm as good.
end
~
$~
